+# Video graphics (task S-9)
+
+Ready-to-use 1920x1080 images for the [video script](../drafts/video_script.md), in the
+website's colors and fonts. Drop them into any editor (iMovie, DaVinci Resolve, CapCut).
+
+| File | Script row | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `phone_text.png` | 0:00-0:25 | The YELLOW text message for the fictional child Maya, generated by `render_sms` (the plan link is a placeholder). Filming a real phone is still better if you can |
+| `title_card.png` | 0:45-1:05 | Name and tagline |
+| `how_it_works.png` | 1:05-1:40 | The three-box diagram the shot list asks for |
+| `who_pays.png` | 3:35-4:00 | Prices from Brief section 9 |
+| `end_card.png` | 4:00-4:20 | Add the category once S-1 confirms it |
+| `caption_gnn.png` | 1:05-1:40 | Transparent caption to lay over the Smoke World recording |
+| `caption_per_day.png` | 1:40-2:00 | Same |
+| `caption_development.png` | 2:00-2:30 | Same. Replace with the final-test wording after D-5 |
+| `caption_simulated.png` | 2:55-3:35 | Same, over the family plan recording |
+
+Source: `scripts/video_cards/cards.html`. To change a word, edit it there and run
+`node scripts/video_cards/render.js` (needs Playwright and `npm ci` in `website-src`
+for the fonts). If a number or price changes in the Brief, change it here too.
